### Canonical Scripture & Commentary Acknowledgments
* Sanskrit shlokas, Hindi translations, and commentaries by Swami Ramsukhdas (*Sadhaka-Sanjivani*) belong to the heritage archive of Gita Press Gorakhpur.
* Classical Advaita commentary belongs to Adi Shankaracharya (*Shankara Bhashya*).
* Word-for-word grammatical concordances belong to Winthrop Sargeant.
* These canonical scriptures are utilized in NityaGeeta strictly for educational, scholarly, reverent, and non-commercial public service in accordance with open cultural heritage.
